{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_023_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8d3527ac83386f643d6e2c1774a18a354abea5da343e3b888c5674e26959bff3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329",
      "text": "几分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bc55d9ff66046c985683a30d2de1e07b452db5aeca589a910558f6d2f63af1a",
      "text": "Peace out！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7783b884043bdb51990b4c7dac3e0753aa5b5df9cb30a5ac6fb150fbd4d23ae3",
      "text": "……久等了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n那家伙把手机弄丢了正发愁呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7d4a9035b3304d6c490bbc14faa04eed5b962c8eab42dfdb0aa56ae64bdeb82",
      "text": "我捡到的手机好像正好就是他的！\n还给他之后他可高兴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aab15c62ff7da0c5aebca3fd48596225825b761a0277c2d4b8303539a9319e51",
      "text": "没想到会在这里遇见他。\n真是吓了一跳啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bef90af0a91b31db47e7ee3757da54eed3e837f6dccdab92e6fb6f838450684",
      "text": "我刚才没太听懂，多亏您帮了大忙。\n非常感谢，春名先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2e95dee857ec7613d722b8951014d6a7c0974a7ab62c025094bb8d3b1946f5b",
      "text": "这点小事不算什么啦。\n之前我和比尔在同一个工地打过工。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80cdf70ded6df277a475bdf775a7e00706fbb9e8634c47021f48926600efae26",
      "text": "那里只有我一个人会说英语，\n给他做着做着翻译就成了朋友。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eae1b8016823d2afe3792cc7ac76b1e24d4aa833de524ac0d875b3c760b0aaf7",
      "text": "不过，搭话的人是比尔真是太好了。\n一开始我还以为你是被不良少年纠缠上了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b947d8b31616008d1469728d7563e4e1c27722bf948618fdd12681f6943afff0",
      "text": "我本以为自己对不良少年和大块头已经挺习惯了，\n但事发突然还是慌了手脚呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_01_1_2_023_01:1_2_023_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0a89c95aff7c786569d1bb290c9772d39ecd218dd6c7494fb95e9fb5c59ced9",
      "text": "哈哈哈。没事，要是出什么事我会保护你的。\n制作人不用担心啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
